# For local `npm run dev`, http://localhost:5000 (or whatever port the
# server actually runs on) is correct. For the packaged Android app
# (capacitor.config.ts), this MUST be your server's real, publicly
# reachable HTTPS URL instead -- "localhost" from inside the app means the
# phone itself, not your dev machine, so the app would just fail to reach
# the API. Set the real URL in client/.env before running `npm run
# android:sync` (which runs `vite build` first, baking this value into the
# bundle -- Capacitor's WebView, unlike a browser, can't be redirected at
# runtime via devtools/query params).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

